---
import BaseLayout from "@/astro/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="页面不存在">
  <main class="shell flex-1 py-16 sm:py-24">
    <div class="measure">
      <p class="text-meta font-medium text-ink-500">404</p>
      <h1 class="mt-3 text-display font-display text-ink-950 text-balance">这个页面不存在</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-body text-ink-700 text-pretty">
        链接可能已经失效，或者这篇资料还没整理进来。
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a
          href="/library"
          class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-control bg-accent-700 px-5 text-label text-on-accent transition-colors duration-150 hover:bg-accent-600"
        >
          去资料库
        </a>
        <a
          href="/"
          class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-control bg-surface-muted px-5 text-label text-ink-950 transition-colors duration-150 hover:bg-surface"
        >
          回到首页
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
